  "description": "Class library providing a framework for building applications that can cooperate and solve problems in clusters. Communication between endpoints in clusters is performed using AES-256 encrypted datagrams over a predefined UDP Multicast channel. Only participants with access to the shared key can participate in the cluster. Supports Unacknowledged, Acknowledged and Assured Message transfers in clusters, as well as Request/Response command executions, Locking of singleton resources, serialization of objects, etc.",
